Package: remote
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-pil, python3-tk
Maintainer: Remote <noreply@example.com>
Description: AnyDesk-style remote desktop for Linux over Tailscale
 Remote lets you control a Linux machine from your phone or another
 computer over a Tailscale network. The host streams its screen as
 compressed frames and injects the viewer's mouse/keyboard input.
 Transport encryption comes from Tailscale (WireGuard); access is gated
 by a password challenge-response handshake.
 .
 v1: X11 screen capture, JPEG frames, password auth, systemd service
 for unattended access.
